# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# [NEXTONES-BROKER-RECONCILER-V2]
# Compare les positions ActivTrades (MetaAPI live) vs portfolio_positions
# Thesium et stocke un rapport dans broker_reconciliation_runs +
# broker_reconciliation_log.
#
# Strategie :
#   1) Fetch positions ActivTrades via metaapi_provider.get_positions()
#   2) Charge portfolio_positions Thesium
#   3) Joint via instrument_broker_mapping (thesium_ticker <-> broker_symbol)
#   4) Calcule drifts (qty et notional)
#   5) Insert resultats dans broker_reconciliation_*
#
# CLI :
#   py -3.13 nextones-broker-reconciler.py [--source SRC] [--no-broker] [--verbose]
#     --source SRC    : 'metaapi_live' (defaut) ou 'shadow_only'
#     --no-broker     : ignore MetaAPI (utile en marche ferme), source shadow_only auto
#     --verbose       : dump positions + log lignes
#
# Code de sortie : 0 = ok, 1 = error (echec broker), 2 = config absente

